      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Wait a minute, wait a minute!\r\nI didn't hear that General\r\nMeirova would be here too.\r\nWell, I don't mind him being here, but...",
        "Jp" : "ちょっとちょっと\r\nメイロワ将軍もいるなんて聞いてないぞ\r\nいや、別にいたからどうってワケでもないけど"
